WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.948 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Welcome back to the threshold of The Signal.

00:00:03.948 --> 00:00:06.527 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This page appears after a return from

00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:09.106 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Whop, but a return alone is not

00:00:09.106 --> 00:00:11.685 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
proof that your free gate is open.

00:00:11.685 --> 00:00:14.633 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Sign in to the Whop account you used

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:17.580 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and look for The Signal in its library.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:20.528 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal is intended as a free room,

00:00:20.528 --> 00:00:23.107 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
with no card requirement or recurring charge.

00:00:23.107 --> 00:00:25.318 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Once Whop confirms access, begin with

00:00:25.318 --> 00:00:27.897 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Dispatches to see announcements and new realms.

00:00:27.897 --> 00:00:30.107 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Then open the First Vision for

00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:31.950 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
an introduction to the chambers.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.897 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The named rooms form a map through the

00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:37.476 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
story: the Signal, the Realm, the Process,

00:00:37.476 --> 00:00:40.424 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the Records, the Session and the Field Journal.

00:00:40.424 --> 00:00:43.740 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Move among them at the pace your account allows.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.007 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The calendar marks the rhythm of upcoming work.

00:00:50.007 --> 00:00:53.767 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Look there for the next realm and the room's announcements.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.398 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Sanctuary is a shared space for

00:00:56.398 --> 00:00:59.030 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
travellers, once your Whop account grants access.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:01.285 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Return to the First Vision whenever

00:01:01.285 --> 00:01:03.165 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
you want to begin again.

00:01:03.165 --> 00:01:06.548 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Sign in with the same account used at entry.

00:01:06.548 --> 00:01:09.556 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
If The Signal is missing from your library,

00:01:09.556 --> 00:01:12.563 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
contact Numinous support with your confirmation and email.

00:01:12.563 --> 00:01:15.571 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Never send a password or full card number.

00:01:15.571 --> 00:01:19.330 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The verified library, not this return page, is the door.
